# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---- Virtual environments ----
venv/
.venv/
env/

# ---- Secrets (never commit a real Google Places key) ----
.env

# ---- Trained artifacts ----
# models/cardio_model.joblib IS committed on purpose (about 1 MB) so a fresh
# clone can run the app immediately. Rebuild it with: python -m src.train
# If you retrain locally, commit the new artifact too, or delete the file and
# let the run script rebuild it.

# ---- Raw data ----
# data/cardio_train.csv IS committed (about 2.8 MB) so training works offline.
# Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/sulianova/cardiovascular-disease-dataset

# ---- Legacy / local junk ----
db.sqlite3
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*tempCodeRunnerFile*
